Q. 8. Write minimum 10 complex queries on MongoDB collections using suitable
operators and query conditions to retrieve, filter and sort documents.
Collection used: hospital.patients (7 documents from Q3). Start with: use hospital

Query 1: Comparison $gt: patients older than 50
  db.patients.find(
